*[[Pedro Santana Lopes]] – former [[Prime Minister of Portugal|Prime Minister]] (2004–2005).<ref>[https://expresso.sapo.pt/politica/2015-08-27-Santana-Lopes-anuncia-que-nao-e-candidato-a-Belem Santana Lopes anuncia que não é candidato a Belém] {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180703051023/http://expresso.sapo.pt/politica/2015-08-27-Santana-Lopes-anuncia-que-nao-e-candidato-a-Belem |date=2018-07-03 }}, ''Expresso'', 27 August 2015. Retrieved 27 August 2015.</ref>
*[[Rui Rio]] – former mayor of [[Porto]] (2002–2013).<ref>[https://expresso.sapo.pt/politica/2015-10-14-Rio-desiste-da-candidatura-a-Belem Rio desiste da candidatura a Belém ], ''Expresso'', 15 October 2015. Retrieved 15 October 2015.</ref>
