===Candidates' debates===
There were several number of debates between all the candidates in the three TV networks RTP, SIC, TVI. There was a radio debate between all candidates plus on January 19, there was a final debate between all of candidates on RTP1.<ref>[http://observador.pt/2015/12/21/maria-belem-sampaio-da-novoa-enfrentam-9-janeiro-todas-as-datas-dos-debates-presidenciais/ Maria de Belém e Sampaio da Nóvoa enfrentam-se a 9 de janeiro. Todas as datas dos debates presidenciais], ''Observador'', 21 December 2015. Retrieved 22 December 2015.</ref>

